      "destination": "reproduction/train_recall.py",
      "extracted_sha256": "3c3c363282b9801c4c0ac82b6a1a4f9c4a92afb09be48c22f0b541f422da300e",
      "adaptation": "Install and apply recorded curricula, enforce common initialization and explicit terminal access, and preserve historical full-batch (32) BF16 optimization. Include scheduled access in checkpoint inference. Use the matched 100-step warmup and constant learning rate for every arm. Enforce the recorded common initialization separately for B8 and B7A1. Verify complete BF16 parameter and buffer initialization against the historical reference instead of platform-dependent FP32 common-parameter bytes."
    },
